---
description: Repository-wide rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full build rules, authoring convention and traps.

- The published artifact is a compiled Tailwind plugin, not CSS.
- `packages/core/generated/` and every `dist/` are build output. Never edit them.
- Verify with `bun run check`, not with a build. Most failure modes here are
  silent.
- Never hand-maintain a list of things that exist in the CSS. Write an extractor.
